[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_01_0010","text":"──啊！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_01_0020","text":"哇，抱歉！护手霜挤太多了……！\n──对了！果穗，不介意的话要不要用？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_01_0030","text":"不介意！\n不过，要怎么用呢……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_01_0040","text":"谢谢！\n呵呵，借你的手用一下哦——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_01_0050","text":"哇……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_01_0060","text":"有没有没抹到的地方呀～？\n开玩笑的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_01_0070","text":"指尖也拜托了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_01_0080","text":"好——\n──怎么样！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_01_0090","text":"手变得好滋润！\n谢谢你，千子前辈！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_01_0100","text":"我才要谢谢你！\n谢谢你愿意收下！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_01_0101","text":"Motion"}]
